y denies it, even with a bit of roughness in his words, which makes Jingma feel that these are all true words. [661] \"However, there is a threatening letter accusing Spring Vegetable of not being suitable for the Crowd God.\" [662] As a result, the topic came back to the same thing. [663] \"How could I possibly understand what's going on? This child who has been diligently practicing and improving, was killed in such a cruel way. If that's not enough, her reputation will be damaged, and she will not rest in peace.\" [664] This was a voice that came from the depths of his throat. [665] In Jirou's eyes, Daichi, who had always been wearing a mask to maintain his dignity, showed a mood with emotional colors for the first time. [666] \"Now, I'm going to ask the family members about the situation.\" [667] Yaoying was about to get up and brush off her skirt when the door suddenly opened. It was Betso Detective. [668] \"What's going on?\" [669] Betso looked at Yaoying's face and then at Daijing, looking back and forth as if comparing something. He asked with a puzzled expression, and the anger that couldn't be contained leaked out from every detail. [670] \"I have entrusted Yaoying-san with the investigation to arrest the killer of Spring Vegetable as soon as possible.\" [671] Daihon sat on the tatami mat, calmly answering, \"I trust you, Detective. If the police can quickly arrest the killer, that would be best. I just want Oyama-san to help, maybe the case will be solved faster.\" [672] \"But unnecessary interference from outsiders could hinder the investigation.\" [673] Bessho stepped forward, but Daihon glared back at him sternly, clearly not accepting his objections. [674] \"But the investigation is just starting, and we can't trust you yet?\" [675] Bessho pressed on, but Daihon glared back at him sternly, clearly not accepting his objections. [676] \"This is a decision made by the head of the Gakumo family, and there is no place for the police to speak. For the polic